                        "entry_id": "0d690428-69d6-30cc-bb4e-f9acc17ab700",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To create or manipulate (something) using visual effects techniques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0aed0ab8-2cbd-4dca-9d72-4ff1f7fcb267",
                                "sense_id": "7ba1bfcd-d3e4-382f-be03-912e85112c5b",
                                "text": "When we were filming all the scenes in Charlie’s house, I had a huge scab. I think they VFX’d it out and that’s where most of the budget went."
